cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LRSinglecell, please cite the LRSinglecell preprint
  (preferred-citation below) and the version of the pipeline you used (the
  Zenodo concept DOI below resolves to the latest release; each release has
  its own version DOI), together with nf-core/scnanoseq and the tools listed
  in CITATIONS.md.
title: "IntGenomicsLab/lrsinglecell"
abstract: >-
  LRSinglecell is a Nextflow pipeline for single-cell/nuclei long-read
  sequencing data from Oxford Nanopore. It processes 10X Genomics cDNA
  libraries (gene and isoform quantification) and single-cell DNA libraries,
  separately or together in one run (e.g. 10X Multiome), from raw FASTQ to
  cell-barcode-tagged, deduplicated BAMs, feature-barcode matrices and QC
  reports. It is derived from nf-core/scnanoseq.
type: software
# Authors follow the nextflow.config manifest and the README credits. Austyn
# Trull and Lara Ianov wrote nf-core/scnanoseq, from which this pipeline is
# derived.
